WEBVTT

a1b2c3d4-0001/10-0
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.500
<v Alex Morgan>Thanks for joining. Goal today: agree the sandbox rollout date for the partner API.</v>

a1b2c3d4-0001/11-0
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:21.000
<v Sam Patel>Engineering can have the sandbox ready on 18 November, provided the rate-limit design is signed off this week.</v>

a1b2c3d4-0001/12-0
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:30.000
<v Sam Patel>The open risk is token expiry handling. We have a spike planned for Monday.</v>

a1b2c3d4-0001/13-0
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Taylor Brooks>I can have usage dashboards for the first three partners ready by the 20th, so we can watch call volumes from day one.</v>

a1b2c3d4-0001/14-0
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:58.000
<v Alex Morgan>Decision: sandbox goes live on 18 November for the pilot partners. Sam owns the rate-limit sign-off by Friday, Taylor owns the dashboards.</v>

a1b2c3d4-0001/15-0
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Alex Morgan>I will update the partner-api page and send the pilot partners a heads-up once Sam confirms.</v>
